activity Monitor Seismic Activity
activity Issue Early Warning
activity Assess Disaster Risk
activity Activate Emergency Response
activity Deploy Rescue Teams
activity Provide Medical Assistance
activity Distribute Relief Supplies
activity Evacuate Affected Population
activity Establish Temporary Shelters
activity Conduct Damage Assessment
bind Monitor Seismic Activity: Seismic Magnitude
bind Assess Disaster Risk: Risk Score
bind Issue Early Warning: Warning Level
bind Activate Emergency Response: Response Status
bind Deploy Rescue Teams: Teams Deployed
bind Provide Medical Assistance: Injured Count
bind Distribute Relief Supplies: Supplies Distributed
bind Evacuate Affected Population: People Evacuated
bind Establish Temporary Shelters: Shelters Established
bind Conduct Damage Assessment: Damage Estimate
Seismic Magnitude: float between 0 and 10
Risk Score: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Warning Level: Low, Medium, High, Critical
Response Status: Initiated, Ongoing, Completed
Teams Deployed: integer between 0 and 50
Injured Count: integer between 0 and 10000
Supplies Distributed: integer between 0 and 20000
People Evacuated: integer between 0 and 50000
Shelters Established: integer between 0 and 20
Damage Estimate: float between 0.0 and 1000000000.0
Init[Monitor Seismic Activity] | |
Response[Monitor Seismic Activity, Issue Early Warning] | | |
Response[Issue Early Warning, Activate Emergency Response] | | |
Chain Response[Activate Emergency Response, Deploy Rescue Teams] | | |
Chain Response[Deploy Rescue Teams, Provide Medical Assistance] | | |
Chain Response[Provide Medical Assistance, Distribute Relief Supplies] | | |0,24,h
Response[Assess Disaster Risk, Evacuate Affected Population] |A.Risk Score > 70 | |
Response[Assess Disaster Risk, Establish Temporary Shelters] |A.Risk Score > 70 | |
Succession[Conduct Damage Assessment, Distribute Relief Supplies] | | |